      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Source summary calls feats Silver Tongued, Skill Bonus x3 and Skill Training, while detailed page splits them into Craftsman Knowledge, Festive Culture and Skilled Traders; detailed listing governs staging.",
        "blocking": true
      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Base land and swim speeds are both 30 ft, but swim speed does NOT grant water breathing. Water Sense only works in the same water body.",
        "blocking": true
      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Fast modifies Base Speed and removes Skilled Traders; speed replacement not supported and is kept unresolved until movement projection review.",
        "blocking": true
      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Focused Study requires skill choices at levels 1, 8 and 16, not one unconditional Skill Focus or all possible skills.",
        "blocking": true
      },
      {
        "path": "/data",
        "reason": "Festive Culture Perform applies to specialties and Craftsman materials restrict bonus; do not auto apply to generic skill group.",
